[center][size=4][b]In vanilla Fallout 4, NPCs never get together on their own. Chemistry lets them find each other and start a scene by themselves. It picks the pair, and Rapport plays the scene.[/b][/size][/center]

[center]
[url=https://github.com/ReidenXerx/fo4-chemistry][img]https://img.shields.io/badge/native%20code-none%20--%20Papyrus%20only-2f8f2f?style=for-the-badge&labelColor=2b2b2b[/img][/url] [url=https://github.com/ReidenXerx/fo4-chemistry/blob/master/LICENSE][img]https://img.shields.io/github/license/ReidenXerx/fo4-chemistry?color=blue&style=for-the-badge&labelColor=2b2b2b[/img][/url] [url=https://github.com/ReidenXerx/fo4-chemistry][img]https://img.shields.io/badge/source-GitHub-181717?style=for-the-badge&labelColor=2b2b2b&logo=github&logoColor=white[/img][/url]
